<title>USA: Standard Commercial registers offering.</title>
<headline>Standard Commercial registers offering.</headline>
<dateline>WILSON, N.C. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Commercial Corp said it has filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a registration statement for a proposed public offering of 3,525,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it proposes to sell 3.5 million shares in the offering, and a shareholder of the company is proposing to sell the additional 25,000 shares.</p>
<p>Standard Commercial said it plans to use the net proceeds of the offering to reduce short-term indebtedness. The offering will be underwritten by Wheat First Butcher Singer and BT Securities Corp.</p>
</text>
